{"title":"2020 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 22","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2_(DeMoivre&#39;s_Formula)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2 (DeMoivre's Formula)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_1_by_Richard_Rusczyk\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution 1 by Richard Rusczyk</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_2_by_StressedPineapple\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution 2 by StressedPineapple</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_22&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/b/0/cb07e848f9188a9fd706d99ab6513a7d949c48a1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a_n)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"35\" height=\"20\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/b/b/3bbc540ba557955e58c4e6099651014d129f2c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(b_n)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"29\" height=\"18\" /> be the sequences of real numbers such that\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/9/1/9917b4f9dba198e73634715eaa0ff52b7e9e3ba5.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[ (2 + i)^n = a_n + b_ni \\]\" width=\"146\" height=\"18\" />for all integers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/f/0/0f0d43e758d9cef0fe802a89ff590f52ee8d766f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n\\geq 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"43\" height=\"15\" />, where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/a/c/dac5dec897250384833e3c1b44639bf91cca823a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$i = \\sqrt{-1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"71\" height=\"21\" />. What is<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/3/a/a3a51079920de0ca06d385c58399f194a5ff90cb.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\sum_{n=0}^\\infty\\frac{a_nb_n}{7^n}\\,?\\]\" width=\"78\" height=\"48\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/0/0/9002273123a848fa8d8ae2c3251b8dc0187688f8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) }\\frac 38\\qquad\\textbf{(B) }\\frac7{16}\\qquad\\textbf{(C) }\\frac12\\qquad\\textbf{(D) }\\frac9{16}\\qquad\\textbf{(E) }\\frac47$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"390\" height=\"38\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_22&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Square the given equality to yield\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/a/f/eafed2044252dfe02ba40174e3fdf1321f502761.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[(3 + 4i)^n = (a_n + b_ni)^2 = (a_n^2 - b_n^2) + 2a_nb_ni,\\]\" width=\"351\" height=\"19\" />\nso <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/2/d/02d32bf9ec699fde51e2f77425e94c77c11b9321.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_nb_n = \\tfrac12\\operatorname{Im}((3+4i)^n)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"177\" height=\"21\" /> and\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/f/8/7f85a857c032580b71599a24b712617c3a49855c.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\sum_{n\\geq 0}\\frac{a_nb_n}{7^n} = \\frac12\\operatorname{Im}\\left(\\sum_{n\\geq 0}\\frac{(3+4i)^n}{7^n}\\right) = \\frac12\\operatorname{Im}\\left(\\frac{1}{1 - \\frac{3 + 4i}7}\\right) = \\boxed{\\frac 7{16}}.\\]\" width=\"483\" height=\"55\" />\n</p><p>comment: lol, idk who write this but it is brilliant\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_2_.28DeMoivre.27s_Formula.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2_(DeMoivre's_Formula)\">Solution 2 (DeMoivre's Formula)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_22&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2 (DeMoivre&#39;s Formula)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Note that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/5/7/a57d15fce8d89c7fad9794670b3596916437fed8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(2+i) = \\sqrt{5} \\cdot \\left(\\frac{2}{\\sqrt{5}} + \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{5}}i \\right)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"226\" height=\"45\" />. Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/1/5/a15dbd8457e74098bc7f2567513db6eea9bd3376.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\theta = \\arctan (1/2)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"127\" height=\"20\" />, then, we know that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/a/f/caf67b2c96ae72039aea91f83a88034fb4d656dd.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[(2+i) = \\sqrt{5} \\cdot \\left( \\cos \\theta + i\\sin \\theta \\right),\\]\" width=\"235\" height=\"21\" /> so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/a/c/fac90b398f88a91f398e5068521866e7bb01fa3b.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[(2+i)^n = (\\cos (n \\theta) + i\\sin (n\\theta))(\\sqrt{5})^n.\\]\" width=\"295\" height=\"21\" /> Therefore, \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/9/0/b902eacbed7cf3d32e8e8ce691c85c43e0607335.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*} \\sum_{n=0}^\\infty\\frac{a_nb_n}{7^n} &amp;= \\sum_{n=0}^\\infty\\frac{\\cos(n\\theta)\\sin(n\\theta) (5)^n}{7^n} \\\\ &amp;=\\frac{1}{2}\\sum_{n=0}^\\infty \\left( \\frac{5}{7}\\right)^n \\sin (2n\\theta)\\\\  &amp;=\\frac{1}{2} \\operatorname{Im} \\left( \\sum_{n=0}^\\infty \\left( \\frac{5}{7} \\right)^ne^{2i\\theta n} \\right). \\end{align*}\" width=\"283\" height=\"167\" />\n</p><p>Aha! <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/e/bce4a4ca9dc22770d8dc7a97af71c234b5d4605c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sum_{n=0}^\\infty \\left( \\frac{5}{7} \\right)^ne^{2i\\theta n}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -20px\" width=\"114\" height=\"48\" /> is a geometric sequence that evaluates to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/8/1/6819afde3a2d38a1cb0a3400d3d3026fdfba0ebe.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{1-\\frac{5}{7}e^{2\\theta i}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -19px\" width=\"71\" height=\"43\" />! Now we can quickly see that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/c/f/1cf16f60a47d91d42ced30101e20f751758a474b.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\sin(2\\theta) = 2 \\cdot \\sin \\theta \\cdot \\cos \\theta = 2 \\cdot \\frac{2}{\\sqrt{5}} \\cdot \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{5}} = \\frac{4}{5},\\]\" width=\"342\" height=\"41\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/7/2/972578bc81fdf63400ca33481570b230c81c05dc.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\cos (2\\theta) = \\cos^2 \\theta - \\sin^2 \\theta = \\frac{4}{5}-\\frac{1}{5} = \\frac{3}{5}.\\]\" width=\"302\" height=\"37\" /> Therefore, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/4/5/9451d5dd164ea7e568ecd31cda21a0acc4edff07.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{1}{1-\\frac{5}{7}e^{2\\theta i}} = \\frac{1}{1 - \\frac{5}{7}\\left( \\frac{3}{5} + \\frac{4}{5}i\\right)} = \\frac{7}{8} + \\frac{7}{8}i.\\]\" width=\"293\" height=\"45\" /> The imaginary part is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/1/7/717366d5cd3f9573014d073ca33467c37c12a364.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{7}{8}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"11\" height=\"37\" />, so our answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/c/9/cc93a6a43197d5f9b5b589945a08db0b47acf4a1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{2} \\cdot \\frac{7}{8} = \\boxed{\\frac{7}{16}} \\Rightarrow \\textbf{(B)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"152\" height=\"48\" />.\n</p><p>~AopsUser101\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3\">Solution 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_22&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Clearly <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/e/9/0e935049a2ac07886c9de319b27c7abf1133969f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_n=\\frac{(2+i)^n+(2-i)^n}{2}, b_n=\\frac{(2+i)^n-(2-i)^n}{2i}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"389\" height=\"40\" />. So we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/b/9/7b92ee563668c063fc4841eb165f021c3574f708.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sum_{n\\ge 0}\\frac{a_nb_n}{7^n}=\\sum_{n\\ge 0}\\frac{((2+i)^n+(2-i)^n))((2+i)^n-(2-i)^n))}{4i(7^n)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -25px\" width=\"457\" height=\"52\" />. By linearity, we have the latter is equivalent to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/4/b1458f09bb9139b8e53ea2e39e6e10c5b0c1f618.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{4i}\\sum_{n\\ge 0}\\frac{[(2+i)^n+(2-i)^n][(2+i)^n-(2-i)^n]}{7^n}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -25px\" width=\"365\" height=\"52\" />. Expanding the summand yields \n\\begin{align*}\n\\frac{1}{4i}\\sum_{n\\ge 0}\\frac{(3+4i)^n-(3-4i)^n}{7^n}&amp;=\\frac{1}{4}[\\frac{1}{1-(\\frac{3+4i}{7})}-\\frac{1}{1-(\\frac{3-4i}{7})}] \\\\\n&amp;=\\frac{1}{4i}[\\frac{7}{7-(3+4i)}-\\frac{7}{7-(3-4i)}] \\\\\n&amp;=\\frac{1}{4}[\\frac{7}{4-4i}-\\frac{7}{4+4i}] \\\\\n&amp;=\\frac{1}{4i}[\\frac{7(4+4i)}{32}-\\frac{7(4-4i)}{32}]=\\frac{1}{4}\\cdot \\frac{56}{32} \\\\\n&amp;=\\boxed{\\frac{7}{16}}\\textbf{(B)}\n\\end{align*}\n-vsamc\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_1_by_Richard_Rusczyk\">Video Solution 1 by Richard Rusczyk</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_22&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution 1 by Richard Rusczyk\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OdSTfCDOh5A\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OdSTfCDOh5A</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_2_by_StressedPineapple\">Video Solution 2 by StressedPineapple</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_22&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution 2 by StressedPineapple\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtube.com/watch?v=NWBPm3lThH4&amp;t=952s\">https://youtube.com/watch?v=NWBPm3lThH4&amp;t=952s</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_22&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"2\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_12A\" title=\"2020 AMC 12A\">2020 AMC 12A</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_12A_Problems\" title=\"2020 AMC 12A Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_12A_Answer_Key\" title=\"2020 AMC 12A Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"2020 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 21\">Problem 21</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_23\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2020 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 23\">Problem 23</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2020 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2020 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_3\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2020 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_4\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2020 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_5\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2020 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2020 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_7\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2020 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_8\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2020 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2020 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2020 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_11\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2020 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"2020 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"2020 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"2020 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"2020 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 15\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_16\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2020 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 16\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"2020 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 17\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_18\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2020 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 18\">18</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_19\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2020 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 19\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_20\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2020 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 20\">20</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"2020 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 21\">21</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">22</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_23\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2020 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 23\">23</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_24\" title=\"2020 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 24\">24</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_25\" title=\"2020 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 25\">25</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AMC_12_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AMC 12 Problems and Solutions\"> All AMC 12 Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex-grow:1;text-align:right\">\n<p>These problems are copyrighted &#169; by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.maa.org\">Mathematical Association of America</a>. \n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017045315\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.036 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.053 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 231/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 2298/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 158/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 5903/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<